# Controls the sdist only — the wheel's contents come from
# [tool.setuptools.packages.find] / package-data in pyproject.toml.
#
# Already included by default, so they are deliberately absent here:
# README.md (project.readme), LICENSE (project.license-files),
# pyproject.toml, the lattice_doe package, and tests/.
#
# docs/ stays OUT on purpose: it is ~1 MB of user guide that would dominate
# the sdist, and it is published on GitHub where people actually read it.
include CHANGELOG.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
